# 3.1.3
 * Bugfix: no more `is_defined_test` deprecations on Twig >= 3.21 (thanks @annadamm-check24)
 * Bugfix: avoid PHP 8.2 deprecation (`Use of "static" in callables`) when parsing docblocks,
    by conflicting with webmozart/assert < 1.11

# 3.1.2
 * Bugfix: syntax error on `enum(FQN).cases()`

# 3.1.1
 * Feature (/ bugfix 😉): leading backslash in FQN is optional

# 3.1.0
 * Feature: Detect invalid named arguments in macro calls

# 3.0.1
 * Bugfix: runtime type assertions support traits

# 3.0.0

 * Implement #2: Psr\Logger
   Adding the `LoggerInterface` dependencies in constructors is b/c-breaking, hence the major version bump.
